    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d806">

                <pb facs="0802" n="704" sameAs="frus:frus1930v02/pg704"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00 Revolutions/20: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Curtis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-02-26T14:00:00-04:40">February 26, 1930—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:25 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>22. In spite of the solemn assurances given to my predecessor<anchor n="6"
                        xml:id="d806-f1"/> and to the authorities, it is now absolutely clear that
                    General Trujillo conspired with the revolutionary leaders and has repeatedly
                    betrayed the Government. For this reason it appears highly desirable that <pb
                        facs="0803" n="705" xml:id="pg705"/> General Trujillo be not named on the
                    list of any party. It is furthermore necessary that General Trujillo and Colonel
                    Díaz, who has likewise been unfaithful, be removed from the Army, but this will
                    hardly be accomplished without the assistance of the Legation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d806-f1" n="6" xml:id="d806-f1-content">
                <p>Reported in despatch No. 1549, December 25, 1929, from the Minister in the
                    Dominican Republic; not printed (839.00/3340).</p>
            </note>
